# Build context is the repo root. Keep secrets, caches and host artefacts out of every image.
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets/

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo

**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

data/
storage/
spikes/
docs/
.claude/
.github/
